+- Host and provider designated requirements match their exact identifiers, Apple generic anchor, redacted Apple Development leaf requirement, and Apple intermediate marker.
+- Both profiles decode and match exact UUID, team, platform, application identifier, and unsuffixed `packet-tunnel-provider` authorization.
